# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion programme's host-gap package WPH (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the fusion integration branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. WPH/ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag the pack's B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# H4b (EXACTNESS, WPH): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-wph-reads-async-audit = the combined fusion arm (c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all: the production profile plus every integrated lever, the round-host levers included) plus QWEN_FAST_BATCHED_READS=async and the audit (the non-blocking copies and one fence; run only when H1 picked async).
# The audit runs beside the lever on the device and logs exact=True or a mismatch. READ: c2_smoke_check clean with the fusion rules and the WPH rule (hostgap_wph_smoke: the engaged lines, at least one passing
# audit line, no fell-back line, no 'audit mismatch', and for the pre-stage diff a [PACKED-PRESTAGE-DIFF] line on the diff path that wrote fewer destinations than it pre-staged), the existing full audit
# ([PACKED-PRESTAGE-FULLAUDIT]) with mismatches=0 on both blocks and on path=diff, no stall, every answer complete. ANY mismatch, fall-back or missing audit line is NO-GO for the lever and skips its timed jobs.
# Duration (estimate): 50 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-wph-reads-async-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k
